; gh-ocannl-2082, gh-ocannl-2139: a diagnostic probe of what macOS does to a Metal command buffer
; that never ends. Built only, never run by any alias: it stalls the GPU, so it runs by hand on a Mac
; with the GPU to itself, through run_cells.sh. It links raw Metal and gpu_recovery, not OCANNL, so
; it reads no configuration.

(executable
 (name metal_hang_probe)
 (optional)
 (enabled_if
  (= %{system} macosx))
 (modules metal_hang_probe)
 (libraries metal ctypes integers unix sexplib0 gpu_recovery))
